{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.ConfinementSdp","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.ConfinementSdp","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.confinement_sdp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.confinement_sdp","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/confinement-sdp.lean#L50-L56","doc":"**Confinement SDP primal–dual**.\nAt any `(P, q)` with Slater-strict feasibility, strong duality holds\nbetween the primal matrix-Frobenius SDP and the dual matrix shadow prices. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData.slaterStrictFeasible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData.slaterStrictFeasible","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/confinement-sdp.lean#L43-L48","doc":"**Slater's condition** for a given SDP context: a strictly feasible\npoint exists.  Restores the name `slaterStrictFeasible` as a definition\nover the carried cone, so call sites read as before while the\nproposition is now fixed rather than chosen. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData.strong_duality","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData.strong_duality","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/confinement-sdp.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Strong duality, hypothesised on **Slater's condition itself** rather\nthan on a proposition the instance picks.\n\n`slaterStrictFeasible : Prop` was a field typed with the universe\n`Prop`, so `strong_duality` read as Slater-conditional while its\nantecedent was whatever the instance chose — `True` included, which\nmakes the implication unconditional.\n\n(Needs abstract LP/SDP duality infrastructure that does not exist in\nMathlib; kept as an honest assumption for models without\ncertificates.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData.y0Star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData.y0Star","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/confinement-sdp.lean#L28-L28","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData.nTarget","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData.nTarget","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/confinement-sdp.lean#L27-L27","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData.primalOpt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData.primalOpt","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/confinement-sdp.lean#L26-L26","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData.Feasible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData.Feasible","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/confinement-sdp.lean#L25-L25","doc":"The primal feasible set. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData.PosDef","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData.PosDef","kind":"def","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/confinement-sdp.lean#L23-L23","doc":"Strict positive-definiteness `Φ ≻ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData.Primal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData.Primal","kind":"def","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/confinement-sdp.lean#L21-L21","doc":"The ambient space of the primal variable `Φ`.  A field because this\nclass held three real optima and no primal variable at all, so there\nwas nothing for Slater's condition to quantify over. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData.mk","kind":"ctor","line":17,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/confinement-sdp.lean#L17-L17","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementSDPData","kind":"class","line":17,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/confinement-sdp.lean#L17-L41","signatureChunk":0}]}